Package: xyz.regulad.aaoracled
Name: aaoracled
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: On-device App Attest oracle. Patches devicecheckd's DCClientHandler to accept a caller-supplied App ID for App Attest, regardless of the calling process's code-signing legitimacy, and installs the aaoracled CLI/daemon that drives DCAppAttestService directly via a REST API.
Maintainer: regulad
Author: regulad
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, com.opa334.libsandy
